{
  "file": "Latent",
  "page": 45,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        53.92389678955078,
        370.345703125,
        70.70689392089844
      ],
      "text": "8.6\t Risk of drug resistance following LTBI treatment",
      "font": "Whitney-Semibold",
      "size": 13.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        76.64232635498047,
        526.6474609375,
        89.44232940673828
      ],
      "text": "Programme-based surveillance systems and clinical studies are needed to monitor the risk for bacterial",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        90.64232635498047,
        526.689208984375,
        103.44232940673828
      ],
      "text": "resistance to the drugs used in LTBI treatment. Particular consideration should be given to rifamycin-containing",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        104.64232635498047,
        238.2230987548828,
        117.44232940673828
      ],
      "text": "regimens because of the dearth of data.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        132.60113525390625,
        338.5958251953125,
        149.38414001464844
      ],
      "text": "8.7\t Adherence to and completion of treatment",
      "font": "Whitney-Semibold",
      "size": 13.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        155.31939697265625,
        524.3662719726562,
        168.119384765625
      ],
      "text": "Carefully designed studies, including RCTs, are required to generate evidence on the effectiveness of context-",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        169.31939697265625,
        526.6699829101562,
        182.119384765625
      ],
      "text": "specific interventions for enhancing adherence and completion of treatment. The studies should include",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        183.31939697265625,
        526.6353149414062,
        196.119384765625
      ],
      "text": "specific risk groups, depending on the available resources and the health system infrastructure. Use of “digital",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        197.31939697265625,
        524.42041015625,
        210.119384765625
      ],
      "text": "health” to improve adherence is an important area. Further research is required on the effectiveness of self-",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        211.31939697265625,
        382.6800842285156,
        224.119384765625
      ],
      "text": "administration of the 3-month regimen of weekly rifapentine plus isoniazid.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        239.2783203125,
        212.0019073486328,
        256.06134033203125
      ],
      "text": "8.8\t Cost–effectiveness",
      "font": "Whitney-Semibold",
      "size": 13.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        261.99664306640625,
        526.6961669921875,
        274.796630859375
      ],
      "text": "Although a number of studies of the cost-effectiveness of TB preventive treatment are available, their wide",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        275.99664306640625,
        526.6634521484375,
        288.796630859375
      ],
      "text": "heterogeneity obviates a comprehensive appraisal of the cost-effectiveness of LTBI management stratified by",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        289.99664306640625,
        526.6471557617188,
        302.796630859375
      ],
      "text": "population group and type of intervention. Direct measurement of cost-effectiveness in certain settings and",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        303.99664306640625,
        402.94818115234375,
        316.796630859375
      ],
      "text": "populations would allow extension of the LTBI strategy at national or local level.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        331.9554138183594,
        423.156982421875,
        348.7384338378906
      ],
      "text": "8.9\t Preventive treatment for contacts of people with MDR-TB",
      "font": "Whitney-Semibold",
      "size": 13.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        354.6737060546875,
        526.6831665039062,
        367.47369384765625
      ],
      "text": "RCTs with adequate power are urgently needed to update the recommendation on preventive treatment for",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        368.6737060546875,
        526.6282348632812,
        381.47369384765625
      ],
      "text": "contacts of people with MDR-TB. Trials should be performed with both adult and paediatric populations and",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        382.6737060546875,
        526.658203125,
        395.47369384765625
      ],
      "text": "with at-risk populations such as people living with HIV. The composition, dosage and duration of preventive",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        396.6737060546875,
        526.6621704101562,
        409.47369384765625
      ],
      "text": "treatment regimens for MDR-TB should be optimized, and the potential role of newer drugs with good",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        410.6737060546875,
        526.6791381835938,
        423.47369384765625
      ],
      "text": "sterilization properties should be investigated. The effectiveness and safety of preventive treatment for",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        424.6737060546875,
        526.648193359375,
        437.47369384765625
      ],
      "text": "contacts of people with MDR-TB should be evaluated in operational conditions. Further evidence on the risk of",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        438.6737060546875,
        526.6152954101562,
        451.47369384765625
      ],
      "text": "contacts of people with MDR-TB for progression to active TB will be important for understanding the benefits",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        452.6737060546875,
        171.03614807128906,
        465.47369384765625
      ],
      "text": "of preventive treatment.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        480.6325988769531,
        247.0953826904297,
        497.4156188964844
      ],
      "text": "8.10\t Programme management",
      "font": "Whitney-Semibold",
      "size": 13.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        503.3509521484375,
        526.646484375,
        516.1509399414062
      ],
      "text": "Epidemiological research should be conducted to determine the burden of LTBI in various geographical settings",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        517.3509521484375,
        524.3612060546875,
        530.1509399414062
      ],
      "text": "and risk groups and as a basis for nationally and locally tailored interventions, including integrated community-",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        531.3509521484375,
        526.67724609375,
        544.1509399414062
      ],
      "text": "based approaches. Research is also needed on service delivery models to ensure that patients are properly",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        545.3509521484375,
        526.6422119140625,
        558.1509399414062
      ],
      "text": "managed including the provision of additional interventions for tobacco smokers, illicit drug users, and people",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        559.3509521484375,
        526.715087890625,
        572.1509399414062
      ],
      "text": "with harmful use of alcohol. Household implementation models could improve the effectiveness and efficiency",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        573.3509521484375,
        526.7041625976562,
        586.1509399414062
      ],
      "text": "of delivery of interventions. Tools should be developed and assessed to facilitate monitoring and evaluation of",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        587.3509521484375,
        220.70811462402344,
        600.1509399414062
      ],
      "text": "programmatic management of LTBI.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        538.5827026367188,
        790.2608032226562,
        555.36669921875,
        810.61279296875
      ],
      "text": "33",
      "font": "Whitney-Light",
      "size": 16.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        444.4356994628906,
        796.524658203125,
        524.409912109375,
        805.5686645507812
      ],
      "text": "8. RESEARCH PRIORITIES",
      "font": "Whitney-Medium",
      "size": 7.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}